OL,3,ABurnham and Macron agree to scale up
OL,4,Aaction on small boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham and French President
OL,7,FEmmanuel Macron have discussed how to
OL,8,F"scale up" efforts to tackle illegal
OL,9,Fmigration and move the UK closer to
OL,10,FEurope, as the new prime minister
OL,11,Fhosted his first foreign leader in
OL,12,FDowning Street.
OL,14,FIn an official readout of their
OL,15,Fmeeting, No 10 said the pair also
OL,16,Fdiscussed production of long-range
OL,17,Fmissiles in Ukraine.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, the prime minister raised
OL,20,FIsraeli plans for new settlements in
OL,21,Fthe West Bank, which he condemned as
OL,22,F"unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
