OL,3,AReform UK promises #80bn cuts to public
OL,4,Aspending
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has pledged to cut #80bn of
OL,7,Fpublic spending within five years by
OL,8,Freducing welfare, net zero policies,
OL,9,Foverseas aid and the number of civil
OL,10,Fservants.
OL,12,FSpeaking from the party's conference in
OL,13,FBirmingham, economic spokesman Robert
OL,14,FJenrick said he would like to cut taxes
OL,15,Fin Reform's first Budget if it wins
OL,16,Fpower at the next election but would
OL,17,Fhave to "earn the trust" of the markets
OL,18,Ffirst.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
