OL,3,APalestinian teens killed during settler
OL,4,Aattack on West Bank village, officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FFunerals have taken place for two
OL,8,FPalestinian teenagers who local
OL,9,Fofficials say were killed by Israeli
OL,10,Fsettlers and soldiers in an attack on
OL,11,Ftheir village in the occupied West Bank
OL,12,Fon Wednesday.
OL,14,FThe village council in al-Mughayyir
OL,15,Ftold the BBC that Omar al-Nassan, 19,
OL,16,Fand Khalil Abu Alia, 16, were killed as
OL,17,Fthey tried to stop Israeli settlers
OL,18,Fstealing sheep and that confrontations
OL,19,Fbroke out.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
